diff --git a/openspec/changes/cycle-11-pipe-od-retrieval-normalization/specs/pipe-od-retrieval-normalization/spec.md b/openspec/changes/cycle-11-pipe-od-retrieval-normalization/specs/pipe-od-retrieval-normalization/spec.md
